{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415032","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415032","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041503201:1":{"text":"啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！","source_cn":"啊，萨基塔里斯！你又在这里偷懒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE77E753B4F63A71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503202:1":{"text":"是塔琳啊，真巧。\n我们是不是有几百年没见过面了？","source_cn":"是塔琳啊，真巧。\\n我们是不是有几百年没见过面了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE83DF9A47871220A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503203:1":{"text":"嗯，我之前稍微出了点状况——\n别岔开话题！","source_cn":"嗯，我之前稍微出了点状况——\\n别岔开话题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F9FBE8AFA1C8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503204:1":{"text":"别这样，塔琳，为了庆祝我们的重逢，今晚要不要来我的宴会？","source_cn":"别这样，塔琳，为了庆祝我们的重逢，今晚要不要来我的宴会？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BBD7A92DDE570A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503205:1":{"text":"我可以为你准备一处专场，用黄金和火红的花朵装饰，再请上几百个诗人为你歌唱——","source_cn":"我可以为你准备一处专场，用黄金和火红的花朵装饰，再请上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4D0ABFEF2BAEFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503206:1":{"text":"唱、唱什么？我可不喜欢最近流行的曲子，太吵闹了。","source_cn":"唱、唱什么？我可不喜欢最近流行的曲子，太吵闹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29AD035C50BC2CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503207:1":{"text":"你对我的品味还不放心吗？\n连斯克嘉莉德都能在我的宴会上找到乐子。","source_cn":"你对我的品味还不放心吗？\\n连斯克嘉莉德都能在我的宴会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCF774FA7A0A360","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503208:1":{"text":"哼……那我等会儿就得准备下发型……","source_cn":"哼……那我等会儿就得准备下发型……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0FA09AB046F8C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503209:1":{"text":"等等！又被你岔开话题了！","source_cn":"等等！又被你岔开话题了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C25B355C5060369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"塔琳","source":"塔琳","status":"source"},"speaker:萨基塔里斯":{"text":"萨基塔里斯","source":"萨基塔里斯","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}